-## 1. Current Baseline Summary
+## 1. Overview of Completed Work
 
-This repository contains the complete **JianghuSect v1.12** cumulative update built on top of `JianghuSect_v1.10`, combining two major overhauls:
+This package contains the complete, cumulative implementation of all three major development phases in this conversation:
 
-1. **Part I — NPC Life, Cognition, Relationships, Martial Progression & Sect Authority Overhaul** (`docs/NEXT_NPC_DEVELOPMENT_PROMPT.md`):
-   - **Phase A (Deterministic Bug Fixes)**: Fixed passive slot bonus matching (`subId` vs `sub`), personal manual/crystal consumption cleanup (`consumeManualFromHolder` / `consumeCrystalFromHolder`), stale `away` expedition reconciliation, and strict single-pass positional Thai log linkification (`UI.linkify`).
-   - **Phase B (Cognition & Aspirations)**: Added persistent life aspirations (`ASPIRATIONS`), multi-step goal plans (`GOAL_PLANS`), bilateral commitments, subjective bounded estimates, and deference-to-master memory (`js/cognition.js`).
-   - **Phase C (Social Actions & Multi-Dimensional Relationships)**: Added `trust`, `gratitude`, `resentment`, `fear`, `debt`, and `obligation` (`ensureRel`) plus autonomous `giftItem`, `shareMedicine`, `flatter`, `guidedStudy`, `paidTraining`, and `personalBrew` actions (`js/ai.js`).
-   - **Phase D (Martial Synergies & Innate Sub-Path Passives)**: Added 14 innate sub-path techniques (`INNATE_SUB_TECHS`), 9 cross-synergy rules (`SYNERGIES`), and multi-axis combat decision scoring (`js/martial.js`, `js/skills.js`, `js/combat.js`).
-   - **Phase E (Sect Office Cadence & Delegation)**: Added office action cadences, delegation chains (`DELEGATION_CHAINS`), merit/CP ledger auditing, and autonomous building upgrade ordering (`js/sect.js`).
+1. **Phase I — NPC Life, Cognition, Relationships, Goals & Authority Overhaul (`v1.10.11` / `1.12.0`)**:
+   - Autonomous 100-bed dormitory progression (`56 + 28 + 16 = 100`), applicant talent tiers & Observable Capability Assessment (`CA`), 5-axis asymmetric relationships (`affinity`, `respect`, `trust`, `gratitude`, `fear`), long-term aspirations & mid-term goals, authority/delegation chains, and single-pass positional log linkification.
+   - Reports: `docs/NPC_ARCHITECTURE_AND_CODE_MAP.md`, `docs/NPC_BUG_FIX_AND_DESIGN_REPORT.md`, `docs/NPC_TEST_AND_SIMULATION_RESULTS.md`.
+2. **Phase II — Graphics, Visual Readability & Mobile UI Overhaul (`v1.10.12`)**:
+   - Wuxia scroll/jade visual identity (`css/style.css`, `js/render.js`, `js/ui.js`), renderer-owned `apCache` (eliminating `n._ap` mutation), pure read-only legendary aura inspection (`R.readOnlyActivePassives`, eliminating `n.passiveLoadout` mutation during `R.draw`), 2-tier cached building sprites (`this.buildingSprites`), viewport-culled night lighting, and paused-mode (`0×`) render throttling.
+   - Reports & Patch: `docs/GRAPHICS_IMPLEMENTATION_REPORT.md`, `docs/GRAPHICS_CODE_MAP.md`, `docs/CODEX_GRAPHICS_REVIEW_HANDOFF.md`, `docs/graphics_update.patch`, `test/results/graphics_before_manifest.json`, `test/results/graphics_after_manifest.json`, and 9 before/after screenshot pairs in `test/results/screenshots/`.
+3. **Phase III — Visitors, Living Clues, Inheritance Stories & Legendary Weapons Overhaul (`v1.10.12` / `1.12.1`)**:
+   - **Persistent Outsider / Visitor Ecology (`js/visitors_clues.js`)**: Non-member guests (`wanderer`, `scholar`, `herbalist`, `artisan`, `envoy`) and traders visit the sect, undergo gate authority screening (`admitted`, `restricted`, `rejected`), walk on the map, converse with disciples, and persist in `W.world.guestRegistry` without ever entering `W.npcs` or counting toward the 100-member bed cap.
+   - **41 Authored Clue & Inheritance Templates (`docs/CLUE_SOURCE_CATALOG.json`)**: 8 ordinary/heritage leads + 22 non-innate legendary martial art leads + 11 legendary weapon leads, with `rootRumorId` provenance tracking, false rumor disproof, `personal` vs. `party_any` vs. `party_all` trial scopes, guardian combat, and replay-safe `VC.grantNamedStoryReward` receipts.
+   - **11 Legendary Weapons across All 7 Weapon Families**: Grounded in Jin Yong and Gu Long research (`docs/LEGENDARY_WEAPON_RESEARCH.md`), with canonical `q`/`quality` normalization, `fixedStats`, `reqStrength` suitability gates, bounded `EFX_LEG_*` combat procs, and distinct visual silhouettes (`R.drawLegendaryWeaponVisual`).
+   - Reports & Patch: `docs/VISITORS_CLUES_IMPLEMENTATION_REPORT.md`, `docs/LEGENDARY_WEAPON_RESEARCH.md`, `docs/CLUE_SOURCE_CATALOG.json`, `docs/VISITORS_CLUES_CODE_MAP.md`, `docs/CODEX_VISITORS_CLUES_HANDOFF.md`, and `docs/visitors_clues_weapons.patch`.
 
-2. **Part II — Graphics, World Presentation, Character Readability & Mobile UI Overhaul** (`NEXT_GRAPHICS_DEVELOPMENT_PROMPT.txt`):
-   - **Direction A (Ink-Wash Jade Mountain Scroll)**: Clustered meadow grass with calm negative space, neighbor-aware water/road verges, 1-tile-padded chunk tree canopies, central Plaza inlaid Bagua/Taiji stone medallion, and upgraded outdoor station props (`js/render.js`).
-   - **Distinct Building Families & Upgrade Stages**: Bespoke architectural silhouettes and functional props across all 25 `MAP.BTYPES`, bounded Lv.1 / Lv.2 / Lv.3+ visual upgrade stages, complete sprite cache keys (`b.id|b.type|b.level|this.S`), and state-bound active facility FX (alchemy vapor, forge hearth glow/smoke, canteen steam when `b.inside.length > 0`).
-   - **Shared Character & Portrait Visual Profile**: Renderer-owned `this.apCache` keyed by live state signature `sig` (eliminating `n._ap` mutation), pure read-only `readOnlyActivePassives(n)` (eliminating `n.passiveLoadout` mutation during `R.draw`), true equipped weapon silhouettes (`SWORD`, `BLADE`, `SPEAR`, `STAFF`, `DAGGER`, and unarmed palm-qi), and sculpted oval portraits (`Render.portrait`).
-   - **Lighting, Quality Levels & Mobile UI**: Pre-rendered cached radial light sprites (`warmLightSprite`) with viewport culling (`114.9 ms → 7.2 ms` night+rain median at `1280×800 @2x`), `Auto` / `Low` / `Standard` / `High` graphics quality selector + `Reduced Motion` toggle, crisp inline SVG icons in `#hudBottom`, `#fabs`, and `#resRow`, and generous Thai line-height (`1.45–1.5`).
